      "contribution": "Renewal construction for beta <= theta/(e-1) (Section 3.2), stability estimate and strict gap (Theorem 2(c)), elementary threshold proof, existence of a minimiser (Theorem 2(d)), the head bounds at the Polya-Vinogradov exponents (Proposition 5, Corollary 6, Theorem 7), the Abel-limit identity in Section 5, the checkers check_c1_*.py, an independent check of Lemma 4 and its scripts, the checks of Theorem 8 (with the form of its tail bound) and Proposition 9, and the proofs of the zero-sum identity and of the slack asymptotic (Section 6). The equality profile is from her Paper 52, Section 5.",
